;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\ホラー.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYMOVIE "桜山頂.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "200" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\坂道1.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>―Still in handcuffs, I went down the slope buried in cherry petals.<PG>
On my shoulders, an officer's jacket that reeked of scorching, flung out of the bus in the explosion.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I pressed my handcuffed hands tight against my chest.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was so cold.<PG>
It was only just April, and on top of that, the petals that kept falling like snow blocked out the sunlight and brought a cold like winter.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I looked up once more at the great cherry trees growing in the city center.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\元木市遠景.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
As I drew nearer, I realized they were bigger than I'd imagined.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even the smallest was about 100 meters tall, and the big ones several times that.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Truly a hideous natural disaster that could only be called a cataclysm.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\坂道1.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Haah... haah..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My breath came out white.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
First, I'll head for the city center and ask for help.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With a cataclysm this big, a rescue team is bound to come soon.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even if I'm sent back to prison, that can't be helped.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I spend the night out here like this, I'll freeze to death.<PG>
Even so, not a single car came by.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This wasn't a road that saw so little traffic.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In a disaster, of course the traffic changes, but still...<PG>
No, I had seen a car stopped on the shoulder here and there.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But none of them had anyone inside.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
They weren't locked, either. Had everyone evacuated on foot?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With the cherry petals piled up like this, driving could get difficult.<PG>
Even supposing the next car had someone in it, would they help me?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I were in their place, I wouldn't.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Because my hands are in handcuffs.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I've got an officer's jacket on over it, but underneath is an inmate's uniform.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Any way you look at it, I'm a dangerous person.<PG>
Especially in an emergency like this, there are bound to be people who take advantage of it to commit robbery or theft.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There's a good chance I'd be taken for one of them.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
From every angle, I'm an inmate, a criminal.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I shouldn't try to get through this by acting like an ordinary person.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "111" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\添え\路駐自動車.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "540" "B" "100" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Another car came into view.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If there's no one in that car, I'm sorry, but I'll rest inside it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Clothes, a snack, something to drink, anything at all, I'd like to help myself to it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So in the end, I'm a thief after all...<PG>
As I'd expected, there was no one in the car.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The lock...
{PAUSE ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\車ドア開く.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
yes, this one wasn't locked either.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\車ドア閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "222" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\添え\路駐運転席.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "20" "C" "300" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The car key had been left inside, too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There was gas, too, so I could drive it to the city center.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But...<PG>
The owner of this car might just have gone to look around.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Taking the car on that chance would be wrong of me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'll move a little later.<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\自動車エンジン.ogg" "SE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
The engine started without trouble.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Cold air blew out of the vents.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
After a while it would turn to warm air.<PG>
It was now 1 p.m.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'll try waiting 2 more hours.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If the owner still hasn't come back by then, I'll use it to get to the city center.<PG>
What about the radio? It should have the latest news.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
............
{PAUSE ""}
I couldn't hear anything at all.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Was it the endlessly falling petals getting in the way?<PG>
To rest my body, I tilted the driver's seat back.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The heater started working, and my body grew warm.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,111,222" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
My eyelids suddenly grew heavy.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Fatigue and tension brought sleep down on me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Passing out earlier hadn't been enough rest, it seemed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then I'll wake up again in 2 hours.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\車走行中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\路駐運転席メイン.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―They say the right way to hold a steering wheel is at 10 and 2.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That is, left hand at the upper left, right hand at the upper right.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But my hands are at 11 and 1.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No―closer to 12 o'clock sharp, maybe.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Because my hands are in handcuffs.<PG>
I'd slept 2 and a half hours since then, but the car's owner never came back.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Come to think of it, when I'd turned on the car's heater, cold air had come out at first.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That meant the car had been sitting abandoned for several hours.<PG>
It had been more than 10 years since I was locked up, but fortunately there seemed to have been no great revolution in how cars were built.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But these piled-up cherry petals were a nuisance, as I'd thought.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The tires didn't roll smoothly, and the petals piling on the windshield wouldn't melt the way snow does.<PG>
I went down the dim slope at a super-safe 10 km an hour.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Little by little the buildings grew in number, and the cherries flaunted their imposing forms at me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even so, there truly wasn't a single person.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As if I alone had been thrown into another dimension.<PG>
No, what else would you call this, if not another dimension?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Once there are giant cherry trees, it's already another dimension.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\車エンジン切る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
―After an hour, I finally reached the city center.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\ホラーインダストリアル.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{PLAYMOVIE "桜山頂.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "200" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\市街地災害後1.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Small fires flickered here and there, but there didn't seem to be any big blazes.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Some buildings had collapsed, but the city center still kept its shape to some degree.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Just what you'd expect of Motoki City, urbanized so quickly in recent years. Its disaster prevention seemed thorough.<PG>
But this was as far as I could go by car.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There were lots of abandoned cars, and rubble lay all over.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
From here, I'd have to go on foot.<PG>
Where I'm going is already decided.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The apartment building where <STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE> lives.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE> turns 32 this year.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I hear she's living alone now, working in Motoki-cho.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE> apparently has no intention at all of getting married.<PG>
I've sent her letters now and then, so I know <STYLE ID="2">Natsumi's</STYLE> address.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
From here, it should take about 20 minutes on foot.
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "245" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
Thanks to prison life, I haven't gotten too out of shape.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I can still move like this at my age, I'm healthy yet.<PG>
Even so, there was still no one around.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Not a sign of people, even in the city center.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Had everyone evacuated, or had they all died?<PG>
In that case, it's strange that I'm the only one here.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Have I wandered into a world beyond dimensions after all?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Another world exactly like the one I was in―<PG>
Why has this world accepted me?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, the prison officers came over here with me too, even if they were corpses.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Which means I should assume the citizens are all dead.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Every last person in Motoki City, dead...<PG>
Then why aren't there even bodies of the citizens?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There were bodies in the bus...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Not that there's any point in thinking about what I can't understand.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\コンビニ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
A convenience store, huh.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even at a time like this, the moment I saw a convenience store, I got hungry.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I slipped in through the half-open door.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\風呂ドア.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\コンビニ店内.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―!!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At last, I'd found people!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
About five people who looked like clerks and shoppers.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But all of them had collapsed where they were, and none of them moved.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Surely not...<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Um, excuse me..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I shook the clerk lying in front of the boxed-meal shelf―
{PAUSE ""}
but the body was stiff.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Just like the bodies in the bus, rigor mortis had set in.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The shoppers, too, were all dead.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There were no wounds, yet they were dead as if they'd had heart attacks.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
I ran out of the convenience store and into the pachinko parlor next door.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\パチンコ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Sure enough, everyone here had collapsed too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Players and staff alike, all dead.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I touched a few of them, but they were dead, just as I'd thought.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I didn't understand―why was everyone dead?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Why had they all died indoors?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\コンビニ店内.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
I went into the convenience store again and stood in front of the boxed-meal shelf.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\ビニール.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
I stuffed a handful of boxed meals into a plastic bag.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The microwave didn't work, so there'd be no warm meal for me.<PG>
It was only 4 p.m., yet it was already getting dark.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I helped myself to a flashlight and batteries, too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And just in case, a lighter and some paper goods that looked like they'd burn well.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
While I was at it, I might as well take everything that looked useful.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There were simple backpacks on display, too.<PG>
Does this count as shoplifting after all?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Or would I get off as an act of necessity?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Well, either way is fine. I need it to survive, so it can't be helped.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This is exactly the kind of case an act of necessity covers, I suppose...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
I unhook the <STYLE ID="3" RUBY="ひも">straps</STYLE>, slip them over my arms and re-thread <STYLE ID="3" RUBY="ひも">them</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Like this I can carry it even in handcuffs.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYMOVIE "桜山頂.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "200" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\市街地災害後1.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I put up an umbrella and <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="かっぽ">strode</STYLE> over the piled-up cherry petals.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The petals sticking to my face and slipping into my collar had me thoroughly <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="へきえき">fed up</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Dry, silky petals brushed against my feet and my umbrella.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
How deep would these cherry petals pile up?<PG>
Eventually they'd pile up too deep to walk through, no, deep enough to bury a person.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Unlike snow, they wouldn't melt.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Would the endlessly falling cherry petals stop once spring was over?<PG>
Right now, the petals were piled about 15 centimeters deep.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Petals getting into my shoes was quite unpleasant.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
They're dry at first, but the friction between foot and shoe squeezes moisture out of them.<PG>
But it really was cold.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I wanted to put on more layers, but as long as I was handcuffed, that was <STYLE ID="6" RUBY="かな">impossible</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Nor could I take any clothes off.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
To take clothes off, I'd have to tear them.
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
;---------------------------------------
; END DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------